<section class="page-shell page-about">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">More than 100 years of serving local businesses.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Price Wholesale Distribution is a family business built in Baltimore and growing with the businesses we serve throughout the Baltimore–Washington region.</p>

    <div class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-intro-main">
        <p class="about-kicker">Since 1921</p>
        <h2>A long history in wholesale distribution.</h2>
        <p>Our roots go back to 1921, when our family began building a business in Baltimore around ice cream and frozen treats. Over the decades, the business evolved along with our customers and the products they needed.</p>
        <p>What began with ice cream grew into a broader wholesale distribution business serving convenience stores, retailers, restaurants, institutions and other businesses throughout the region.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-history-card">
        <span>OUR ROOTS</span>
        <strong>1921</strong>
        <p>Baltimore, Maryland</p>
        <div class="history-line"></div>
        <small>Originally operating as <strong>Tutti Frutti Ice Cream Co.</strong>, our early business was built around ice cream and frozen treats.</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-today">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Today</p>
        <h2>Price Wholesale Distribution</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Today, Price Wholesale Distribution provides businesses with a broader selection of the products they need to keep their shelves, freezers and coolers stocked.</p>
        <p>Our catalog includes <strong>ice cream and frozen desserts, beverages, snacks and food products</strong> from brands our customers know and trust.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values">
      <div>
        <span>01</span>
        <strong>OVER 100 YEARS</strong>
        <p>More than a century of experience serving businesses in our region.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>02</span>
        <strong>FAMILY OWNED</strong>
        <p>A business built on personal service, trust and long-term relationships.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>03</span>
        <strong>LOCAL DISTRIBUTION</strong>
        <p>Wholesale service focused on the Baltimore–Washington market and surrounding communities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-next">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Ready to Work With Us?</p>
        <h2>Let's build a wholesale relationship.</h2>
        <p>Tell us about your business and we'll help you get started with Price Wholesale Distribution.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pages/become-a-customer">Become a Customer</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-intro { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.45fr) minmax(280px,.75fr); gap:70px; margin-top:52px; align-items:center; }
  .about-intro-main { max-width:820px; }
  .about-kicker { margin:0 0 12px; color:var(--red); font-size:12px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .about-intro-main h2 { margin:0 0 20px; color:var(--navy); font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px); line-height:1.04; }
  .about-intro-main p:not(.about-kicker) { color:var(--muted); font-size:18px; line-height:1.72; margin:0 0 18px; }
  .about-intro-main strong { color:var(--navy); }
  .about-history-card { padding:38px; border-top:5px solid var(--red); background:var(--cream); }
  .about-history-card > span { display:block; color:var(--red); font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.18em; }
  .about-history-card > strong { display:block; margin-top:12px; color:var(--navy); font-size:64px; line-height:1; font-weight:900; }
  .about-history-card > p { margin:8px 0 22px; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
  .history-line { width:42px; height:3px; margin-bottom:20px; background:var(--red); }
  .about-history-card small { display:block; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; }
  .about-history-card small strong { color:var(--navy); }
  .about-today { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:70px; margin-top:80px; padding:55px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .about-today h2 { margin:0; color:var(--navy); font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px); line-height:1.05; }
  .about-today p { margin:0 0 18px; color:var(--muted); font-size:17px; line-height:1.65; }
  .about-today strong { color:var(--navy); }
  .about-values { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:60px; }
  .about-values > div { padding:30px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--white); }
  .about-values span { display:block; margin-bottom:22px; color:var(--red); font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .about-values strong { color:var(--navy); font-size:14px; }
  .about-values p { margin:9px 0 0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.55; }
  .about-next { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:40px; margin-top:65px; padding:40px; background:var(--navy); color:var(--white); }
  .about-next h2 { margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--white); font-size:32px; line-height:1.1; }
  .about-next p:not(.eyebrow) { margin:0; color:#dbe5ef; }
  .about-next .btn { flex:0 0 auto; background:var(--white); color:var(--navy); }
  @media (max-width:900px) { .about-intro, .about-today, .about-values { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .about-intro { gap:35px; } .about-today { gap:25px; } }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .about-history-card { padding:28px; } .about-next { flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; padding:28px; } .about-next h2 { font-size:28px; } }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Us",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{"name":"About Us"}]
}
{% endschema %}
